WEBVTT

00:27:32.583 --> 00:27:34.268
But in negotiations at work,

00:27:34.292 --> 00:27:37.434
people often have to
give up something of real value.

00:27:37.458 --> 00:27:40.059
If the stakes are high and the ask is big,

00:27:40.083 --> 00:27:43.684
it can be tough to figure out
what will get people to say yes,

00:27:43.708 --> 00:27:45.309
especially if it's a deal

00:27:45.333 --> 00:27:47.250
that affects the entire planet.

00:27:48.792 --> 00:27:51.976
Christiana Figueres: When I got the call,
I was in total disbelief.

00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:53.434
I was in shock.

00:27:53.458 --> 00:27:56.458
Oh my God, I got this responsibility.

00:27:57.583 --> 00:28:01.809
AG: Christiana Figueres
was a diplomat in Costa Rica for decades.